title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › When a system does not answer
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: In real life a payer's system can be down, slow or silent. The demo shows one fallback only: for Evergreen, Caller phones the payer. It has no error screen, no retry button and no failed check. Bad answers become a 'Fix before billing' result.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the retry ladder on the right is how production works (from the product requirements). None of it is drawn on screen.
---
start s1 "Verify reaches the benefits question for the chosen payer"

group gDemo "In the demo"
  decision d1 "Is the payer Evergreen?"
  process p1 "Benefits row ticks\n'Evergreen's system did not answer'"
  agent a1 "Caller\n'Evergreen did not answer online. Caller is phoning'"
  wait w1 "About 2.6 seconds"
  process p2 "Row ticks 'Caller phoned Evergreen, confirmed the answers and logged the call'"
  process p3 "Result lists the call under 'What the agents checked'\n'Phone call to Evergreen' 1:34, reference C-4471"
  process p4 "Every other payer\nThe plan answers at once and the check goes on"
endgroup

group gReal "Production, simulated here"
  ext r1 "Clearinghouse 270/271 inquiry for the plan and the service types"
  decision r2 "Payer answers with the benefit detail?"
  wait r3 "Payer unable to respond: retry after 30 minutes, then 2 hours"
  ext r4 "Verify checks the payer portal with the clinic's saved sign-in"
  decision r5 "Portal answers?"
  agent r6 "Caller phones provider services\nCall logged with a transcript and a result"
  process r7 "Row marked as old, not as lapsed\nNo alert until the third failure"
  process r8 "Answer read, the check goes on"
endgroup

group gBad "When the answer is bad, not missing"
  decision b1 "What did the checks find?"
  process b2 "Member ID ends 1012\n'coverage lapsed 10/12'"
  process b3 "Member ID ends 9999\n'no coverage found for these details'"
  process b4 "Evergreen with Detox\n'The clinic is not enrolled for this program'"
  process b6 "Member ID ends 3030\n'does not cover Residential 3.5'"
  process b7 "Member ID ends 6060\n'Another plan pays first'"
  process b8 "Member ID ends 9090\n'All 14 days are used'"
  process b5 "The check still runs to the end and opens a result\nVerdict 'Fix before billing'"
endgroup

start s2 "While the check runs, leave the page\n(sidebar, back link or browser Back)"
endx e1 "The check is dropped\nNothing is saved: no row, no badge change\nOpen 'Verify a patient' and start again"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The check finishes and is saved"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| p1 --> a1 --> w1 --> p2 --> p3 --> b1
d1 -->|No| p4 --> b1
b1 -->|All clear| g2
b1 -->|Lapsed| b2 --> b5
b1 -->|Not found| b3 --> b5
b1 -->|Not enrolled| b4 --> b5
b1 -->|Not covered| b6 --> b5
b1 -->|Other plan| b7 --> b5
b1 -->|Limit reached| b8 --> b5
b5 --> g1
s1 -.-> r1
r1 --> r2
r2 -->|Yes| r8
r2 -->|No| r3 --> r4 --> r5
r3 -.-> r7
r5 -->|Yes| r8
r5 -->|No| r6 --> r8
s2 --> e1
